<BaseLayout title="About Invoice Workshop" description="Learn why Invoice Workshop builds free, private, browser-based business document tools without signup." path="/about/">
  <article class="simple-page"><p class="eyebrow">About us</p><h1>Business paperwork should feel like useful software.</h1><p class="lead">Invoice Workshop makes practical document tools that work immediately, remember your details on your device, and never require an account.</p><h2>Why we built it</h2><p>Small businesses and independent professionals often need a polished invoice, quotation or work order now—not another subscription or login. We combine a focused editor, reliable calculations, local persistence and professional PDF output in a fast website.</p><h2>Our product principles</h2><ul><li>No signup for core document workflows.</li><li>Customer and document data stays in the browser in V1.</li><li>Every public page contains a genuinely useful tool.</li><li>Clear design, accessible controls and dependable calculations come first.</li><li>Advertising must never imitate actions or interfere with document creation.</li></ul><div class="callout"><strong>No signup, but it remembers you.</strong><br/>IndexedDB keeps your profile, customers, catalog and drafts on this browser. You can export a backup or clear everything at any time.</div></article>
